# Records docs/demo.gif with vhs (brew install vhs). Run from the repo root after pip install -e ".[all]".
Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Type "python examples/demo.py" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 45s
